# TEST FIXTURE (LABS-1.022): a minimal laboratory profile for installation and subtype tests. Not the D-3 profile:
# its labels differ from the real laboratory profile's, so both install together (LABS-1.028, D-D3-5).
define
entity aliquot sub physical-object;
entity core-aliquot sub aliquot;                                                 # a deeper sortal
relation step-of sub part-of;                                                  # a step of an experiment
relation protocol-step-of sub step-of;                                         # a deeper subtype
relation aliquoting sub event, relates taker as actor, relates taken-from as origin, relates portion as destination;
particular plays aliquoting:taker, plays aliquoting:taken-from, plays aliquoting:portion;
